r Nofriansyah Yosua Hutabarat.\n\nTribrata resmi dilantik usai lulus dari Akademi Kepolisian (Akpol) dalam Upacara Prastya Perwira TNI-Polri di Istana Merdeka, Jakarta, Rabu (22/7). Meski tak ditemui langsung oleh sang ayah maupun ibunya, Putri Candrawathi, Tribrata tetap mendapat sambutan hangat dari para pejabat yang hadir.\n\nTribrata mendapat sambutan dari Kapolda Riau, Herry Heryawan alias Herimen. Tak hanya itu, Mendagri Tito Karnavian juga sempat berfoto bersama dengan Tribrata.\n\nTribrata masuk Akpol pada 2023 lalu. Tak lama setelah sang ayah tersandung kasus pembunuhan. Kini, Tribrata melanjutkan perjuangan sang ayah untuk mengabdi kepada negara.\n\n📸: Dok. YouTube Sekretariat Presiden, Instagram @herryheryawan.\n\nBaca selengkapnya dengan klik link di bio. Cari tahu berita update lainnya dengan download aplikasi kumparan di App Store atau Google Play. \n\n📝: newsupdate | update | news | vidol | R203 | E053 | E120\n\n#bicarafaktalewatberita #kumparan", "user": {"strong_id__": "3286401357", "pk": "3286401357", "pk_id": "3286401357", "id": "3286401357", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841403160730800", "username": "kumparancom", "full_name": "kumparan", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3942471290837960062_3286401357", "profile_pic_url": "https://instagram.falc2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-19/750054055_18477365803105358_801769935682138634_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=instagram.falc2-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHr7d8Sas6msY_248d6kpIJhXcFXDorHQvvb6OHMQ9qBPDO8AIPluAm3KDQLSid0GY&_nc_ohc=OPnVeTxw0qgQ7kNvwFoz8am&_nc_gid=CPvkppl716BcgBP3UPdjwA&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQAyrz1OqpOBdTu4mugP97-jFJQ9Nj9YR2LycAczyXjLAg&oe=6A6757F3&_nc_sid=ee9879"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Standing firm at the very front row, right in front of President Prabowo Subianto, Tribrata Putra, officially appointed as Inspector of Police Two (IPDA). He is the son of ex Kadiv Propam Polri, Ferdy Sambo, a former policeman who became convicted of the murder of Brigadier Nofriansyah Yosua Hutabarat.\n\nTribrata officially inaugurated after graduating from Police Academy (Akpol) in the Ceremony of TNI-Polri Officers in Merdeka Palace, Jakarta, Wednesday (22/7). Although not found directly by her father or mother, Princess Chandrawathi, Tribrata still received a warm welcome from the officials present.\n\nTribrata gets a welcome from Kapolda Riau, Herry Heryawan alias Herimen. Not only that, Mendagri Tito Karnavian also managed to take a picture with Tribrata.\n\nTribrata entered Akpol in the last 2023. Shortly after the father stumbles on a murder case. Now, Tribrata continues the father's fight to serve the country.\n\n📸: Dr. Presidential Secretariat YouTube, Instagram @herryheryawan.\n\nRead more by clicking on the link in the bio. Find out more update news by downloading the Coil app on the App Store or Google Play.\n\n📝: newsupdate | update | news | vidol | R203 | E053 | E120\n\n #bicarafaktalewatberita #kumparan"}, "comment_count": 1355, "comment_likes_enabled": true, "play_count": 712211, "ig_play_count": 712211, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "video_duration": 22.933000564575195, "is_dash_eligible": 1, "video_dash_manifest": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<MPD xmlns=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011 DASH-MPD.xsd\" profiles=\"urn:mpeg:dash:profile:isoff-on-demand:2011\" minBufferTime=\"PT2S\" type=\"static\" mediaPresentationDuration=\"PT22.933332S\" FBManifestTimestamp=\"1784781439\" FBManifestIdentifier=\"Fv7pjKYNGBFpZ19kYXNoX2Jhc2ljX3ZwORlWlK709IC0tAeijc39gbS0B8yA5ICCtLQHoOeRh4K0tAfK2qiKgrS0ByIYGGRhc2hfbG5faGVhYWNfdmJyM19hdWRpbyI2ABQAEhQCAA==\"><Period id=\"0\" duration=\"PT22.933332S\"><AdaptationSet id=\"0\" contentType=\"video\" subsegmentAl